box2d-java jextract fork: source changes
========================================

Text changes on top of openjdk/jextract commit 3be13db493b35bca7b714393b89b1a2e1b2d7e13.
The Gradle wrapper (9.6.1) is not in this patch: its files are in overlay/ and are copied over
the checkout. .github/workflows/check-bindings.yml applies both, so CI builds the same jextract
as the local fork. Recreate (in the jextract checkout), keeping this header:

  git diff HEAD -- build.gradle src > <box2d-java>/jextract/fork/fork.patch

- build.gradle: property checks moved out of configuration closures (task-model warm-up fix)
- HeaderFileBuilder: C_LONG = ValueLayout.JAVA_INT on Windows (not needed for box2d-java any
  more, since generateBindings strips that line, but kept so the patch is the fork as is)

